- Name, relationship type, category (inner-circle/close/acquaintance)
- Birthday, anniversary, contact info (phone, email, preferred method)
- Interests, conversation topics, dietary preferences
- Gift preferences and history
- Touchpoint tracking: last contact, frequency goal, next reminder, history
